<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2004/26/msa@/~cl_10> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "10" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2004/26/msa@> .
