<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2004/26/msa@/~cl_6A__subsec_1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2004/26/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2004/26/msa@/~cl_6A__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "An owner shall provide an option to the hirer for the terms charges under a hire-purchase agreement to be at a fixed rate or at a variable rate."@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2004/26/msa@> .
