<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2004/26/msa@/~cl_6A__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "2" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2004/26/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2004/26/msa@/~cl_6A__subsec_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2004/26/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2004/26/msa@/~cl_6A__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "A variable rate of terms charges shall be quoted at a margin percentage above the base lending rate. Right of owner to revise the base lending rate"@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2004/26/msa@> .
