<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2004/26/msa@/~cl_6B__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "Where in the hire-purchase agreement the terms charges are at a variable rate, the owner may revise the base lending rate at any time during the continuance of the agreement. Sewa Beli (Pindaan)"@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2004/26/msa@> .
